            {
              "id": "1764960467763_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Inputs**  \n- **Query Response:** `{{$context.$variables.responseDetails}}`\n- **Context Details:** `{{$context.$variables.contextDetails }}`\n- **Action Details:** `{{$context.$variables.actionDetails}}`\n- **Communication Details:** `{{$context.$variables.communicationDetails}}`\n- **Login user (email sender):** `{{$context.$user.$name}}`\n- **current date:** `{{$context.$system.$currentDate}}` \n---\n### **Tasks**\n0. use current date as today date\n1. **Display the Query Response, summarized and aligned with the Inbound Context Details and User Request:**\n    - Show a summary at the top, highlighting the most relevant context for the user request.\n    - Do **not** include JSON output, action details, actionable insights, or priority actions in the user-facing response text.\n    - Do **not** display `personId` or `assignmentId` in the response text.\n    - Repcounts: x - y in response indicate that employee has x number of Direct reportees and y number of Total reportees.\n\n3. **Using only from available Action Details (actionCode, actionCondition) aligned with User Request**  \n   - Provide priority actionable insights (ranked by priority, relevance) in below sample format\n{\n  \"title\": \"Suggestion: turn off lights\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"No one was detected in the house, suggest you turn off the lights.\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Turn Off Lights\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(\\\"sendAgentCmd\\\",  \\\"<payload>\\\")\",\n  \"priority\":\"false\"\n}\n - <payload> format is `{\"actionCode\": \"<actionCode>\"}`\n - Include actions along with widgets only if relevant else show separately as action items. \n - consider actions based on actionCondition  \n - use actionCode, actionTitle, actionText, actionPurpose available only from the **Action Details**\n - followUpCommand must include \"sendAgentCmd\"\n\n\n---\n---\n\n**User Request:**  \nCurrent prompt: `{{$context.$variables.userPrompt}}`  \nChat history: `{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}`"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
