            {
              "id": "1764964773691_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Inputs**  \n- **User Request:** `{{$context.$variables.userPrompt}}`\n- **Query Response:** `{{$context.$variables.responseDetails}}`\n- **Current date:** `{{$context.$system.$currentDate}}`\n- **Date Interpretation Rules:** `{{$context.$variables.DateInterpretationRules}}`\n\n--\nUse Date Interpretation Rules wherever necessary.\n Eg, \n         - To identify new hires.\n         - To identify employee absence details.\n---\n### **Tasks**\n1. **Present the Query Response aligned with User Request**\n   - Do **not** display or reference actionable insights or priority actions.\n   - Do **not** include `personId` or `assignmentId` fields in the user-visible response text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
